                    "code": "x1 = in1;\r\nx2 = in2;\r\nx3 = in3;\r\nx4 = in4;\r\n\r\n// intermediate sums\r\ns1 = x1 + x3;\r\ns2 = x2 + x4;\r\n\r\n// stereo outputs (inverted)\r\nout1 = (s1 - s2) * in5;   // Left\r\nout2 = (s1 + s2) * 0.25;   // Right\r\n",
