                                        "code": "Delay dly(11025);\r\n\r\n// read control\r\nms = in2;\r\n\r\n// clamp predelay time\r\nms = max(0, min(250, ms));\r\n\r\n// ms -> samples\r\nds = (ms * samplerate) / 1000;\r\n\r\n// safety clamp\r\nds = max(0, min(11024, ds));\r\n\r\n// process\r\ndly.write(in1);\r\nout1 = dly.read(ds);"
